/*
 * hub-backend-config.h.example - Template for the Hub's private
 * Supabase project ref
 *
 * Copy this file to hub-backend-config.h (which is gitignored) and fill
 * in your own Supabase project ref. The Hub dock's injected JS
 * (push-to-studio-script.h) watches Supabase's own localStorage session
 * key, which is named "sb-<project-ref>-auth-token" — without the real
 * project ref here, auth session capture will never find a session to
 * read, and other HelixTools plugins that rely on it (clip, overlays)
 * won't have credentials to work with.
